Random-Walk-On-Sphere-Packings

BouRabeeGwynne/: copied from Leonardo Bonanno's lean-formalizations,
https://github.com/leobon12/lean-formalizations, commit
cf73d6e115827859895cbbd3a3556bf602db32d6, directory BouRabeeGwynne/ (the
formalization of the paper described in results/bou-rabee-gwynne/ of that
repository). Module paths and declaration names are unchanged. The 319 Lean files
of BouRabeeGwynne/ are copied source, not a dependency: this repository builds
without that repository. Each copied file names its source file and commit in its
header. Apart from that header, the files are unchanged, except that 13 of them
add `omit [Fintype V] in` before declarations that do not use the finiteness of
the state space, as their headers state.

The files under BouRabeeGwynne/Upstream/BrownianMotion/ and the excerpt
BouRabeeGwynne/DyadicExitApprox.lean were vendored by Leonardo Bonanno from
https://github.com/RemyDegenne/brownian-motion, commit
314f04a34ff75e18fd383917ae7fe7d77beb1b6f, and the files under
BouRabeeGwynne/Upstream/KolmogorovExtension/ from
https://github.com/RemyDegenne/kolmogorov_extension4 (Rémy Degenne and Peter
Pfaffelhuber), commit 7d76e184c3d2138a2741baf923b57e9a01b9cf25, both under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Their copyright and author lines are kept, and the
LICENSE and PROVENANCE.md files of each directory under BouRabeeGwynne/Upstream/
give the licence text and the provenance. BouRabeeGwynne/BrownianProjectiveLaw.lean
adapts the extension proof of kolmogorov_extension4.

SpherePackingsAudit/Vocabulary/BouRabeeGwynne/: declarations of the copied files
of BouRabeeGwynne/, copied verbatim for the comparator challenges; each file names
its source in its header.
